<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><oois xmlns="http://www.outdooractive.com/api/"><tour id="806658978" type="5250" frontendtype="tour" ranking="81.0"><category id="1589846" name="Trails" iconUrl="https://res3.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/maroon/mountainbiking.square_vector.svg" iconInactiveUrl="https://res.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/grey80/mountainbiking.square_vector.svg" iconMapUrl="https://res3.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/maroon/mountainbiking.map_vector.svg" iconInactiveMapUrl="https://res.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/grey80/mountainbiking.map_vector.svg" iconTransparentUrl="https://res3.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/mountainbiking.geocontent.png" strokeColor="#ff0000" mapOverlays="mtb"><datatype>mountainbiking</datatype></category><title>SH 08 Thurner-Line am Kohlmais</title><localizedTitle lang="en"><value>SH 08 Thurner Line at Kohlmais</value></localizedTitle><localizedTitle lang="fr"><value>SH 08 Thurner-Line au Kohlmais</value></localizedTitle><localizedTitle lang="es"><value>SH 08 Thurner-Line en Kohlmais</value></localizedTitle><localizedTitle lang="it"><value>SH 08 Thurner-Line al Kohlmais</value></localizedTitle><shortText>&lt;p>Die neue Thurner-Line am Kohlmais erwartet euch mit einem lässigen und abwechslungsreichen Mix aus Kurven und Features für fortgeschrittene Mountainbiker.&lt;/p></shortText><longText>&lt;p>Die Thurner Line bringt 2025 noch mehr Abwechslung auf die Trails in Saalbach Hinterglemm. Der Trail beginnt mit einem anspruchsvollen Wurzeltrail, der sofort fordert und ein gutes Gefühl für die Strecke vermittelt. Anschließend führt die Strecke durch einen dichten Wald, der mit natürlichen Hindernissen und abwechslungsreichen Kurven aufwartet. Auf der Strecke warten Sprünge, die sowohl für fortgeschrittene Fahrer:innen als auch für Anfänger:innen geeignet sind.&lt;/p>&#xd;
&lt;p>In Richtung Schönleiten geht es zukünftig weiter, begleitet von wunderschönen Ausblicken. Der Rückweg zur Talstation wartet mit flüssigen Kurven und kleineren Wellen. Die Thurner Line vereint technische Passagen und flüssige Abschnitte und bietet so ein vielseitiges Erlebnis für alle Biker:innen.&lt;/p>&#xd;
&#xd;
&lt;p>Mit ein paar Mal in die Pedale treten gelangt man wieder direkt zur Panorama-Line auf Höhe der Panorama Alm und zurück zur Kohlmaisbahn in Saalbach.&lt;/p></longText><primaryImage id="609825647"><title>Thurner-Line am Kohlmais</title></primaryImage><geometry>12.671674,47.403111,1766 12.671558,47.403134,1764 12.671498,47.403126,1762 12.671441,47.4031,1759 12.671414,47.403051,1757 12.671431,47.403,1757 12.671597,47.402874,1757 12.671822,47.402743,1757 12.67203,47.402565,1754 12.672255,47.402336,1752 12.672343,47.402174,1751 12.672436,47.402052,1750 12.672585,47.401917,1747 12.672781,47.401763,1746 12.672813,47.401738,1746 12.672827,47.401702,1745 12.672805,47.401667,1744 12.672767,47.401645,1744 12.672664,47.401621,1743 12.672597,47.401598,1743 12.67256,47.401566,1742 12.672551,47.401533,1742 12.672578,47.40151,1741 12.672749,47.401447,1740 12.673228,47.40127,1740 12.67337,47.401215,1739 12.67351,47.401179,1738 12.673655,47.401152,1739 12.673941,47.401107,1738 12.674013,47.40109,1738 12.674069,47.401063,1737 12.674083,47.401016,1735 12.674077,47.400986,1734 12.67399,47.400967,1733 12.673802,47.40095,1733 12.673732,47.400926,1732 12.673717,47.400896,1730 12.673738,47.400866,1729 12.674008,47.400799,1728 12.674051,47.400774,1727 12.67406,47.400756,1726 12.674052,47.400732,1725 12.674028,47.400721,1725 12.673964,47.400712,1725 12.673904,47.400697,1725 12.673838,47.400693,1724 12.673732,47.400709,1724 12.673696,47.40071,1723 12.673664,47.400696,1722 12.673655,47.400666,1721 12.67368,47.400642,1721 12.673765,47.400609,1720 12.673834,47.400588,1721 12.673907,47.400576,1721 12.673937,47.400576,1721 12.673967,47.400584,1721 12.674026,47.400609,1721 12.674094,47.400663,1722 12.674122,47.400678,1722 12.674161,47.400675,1721 12.674177,47.400661,1720 12.674139,47.400597,1718 12.674069,47.400535,1717 12.674014,47.400477,1716 12.673991,47.400443,1715 12.674003,47.400415,1714 12.674043,47.400405,1713 12.674085,47.400411,1713 12.674167,47.40048,1714 12.674263,47.40054,1714 12.6